\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Commander complete input/output data-flow (verified from source code). All input channels are uORB topics; Commander never reads sensors or actuators directly. The companion computer has \emph  {two} separate paths: MAVLink (via the \texttt  {mavlink} module $\to $ \texttt  {vehicle\_command}) and XRCE-DDS (\texttt  {vehicle\_command\_mode\_executor}). The \texttt  {action\_request} topic is published \emph  {exclusively} by the \texttt  {ManualControl} module from RC pilot inputs, never by the companion.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:commander_flow}{{1}{5}{Commander complete input/output data-flow (verified from source code). All input channels are uORB topics; Commander never reads sensors or actuators directly. The companion computer has \emph {two} separate paths: MAVLink (via the \texttt {mavlink} module $\to $ \texttt {vehicle\_command}) and XRCE-DDS (\texttt {vehicle\_command\_mode\_executor}). The \texttt {action\_request} topic is published \emph {exclusively} by the \texttt {ManualControl} module from RC pilot inputs, never by the companion}{figure.1}{}}
